# Netlify Redirects & Proxy Rules (Evaluated top-to-bottom)

# 1. Proxy all API traffic to the live Render PostgreSQL backend
/api/*          https://myecommers-for-qaautomation.onrender.com/api/:splat    200!

# 2. Redirect API documentation routes to live Swagger UI
/api-docs*      https://myecommers-for-qaautomation.onrender.com/api-docs:splat  302!
/docs           https://myecommers-for-qaautomation.onrender.com/api-docs/     302!
/swagger        https://myecommers-for-qaautomation.onrender.com/api-docs/     302!

# 3. Single Page Application (SPA) HTML5 History fallback for /delivery, /admin, etc.
/*              /index.html                                                    200
